{
  "_read_me": [
    "SKELETON of cv-data.en.json, the English master CV content. Never put a real candidate in this file:",
    "copy it to templates/cv/cv-data.en.json (ignored by git) and replace every placeholder with your own data.",
    "Same structure as cv-data.template.json. Experiences, projects and skills below are EXAMPLES (same shape, your content).",
    "Writing rules: no « intern » / « apprentice » in experience titles; every experience ends with a measured result",
    "« Result: ... »."
